# Dependencies and build output that must never be published.
node_modules/
*.tgz

# Local run artifacts: every isolated DSH_HOME / port / scratch directory the
# capture scripts create while measuring lives under one of these names.
.m*-home/
.m*-tmp/
.scratch/
*.log
*.local.*

# Local capture inputs. docs/reference/ holds screenshots of the maintainer's
# own desktop, which is reference material for the port — never repository
# content.
docs/reference/

# Local capture evidence. The capture scripts write geometry JSON, per-module
# screenshots and the nine-module status log; all of it quotes live session
# titles, workspace paths and host DOM from a real instance, so it stays on the
# machine that produced it (see docs/testing.md → "Why the evidence is local").
docs/*
!docs/about.md
!docs/architecture.md
!docs/design-tokens.md
!docs/development.md
!docs/limitations.md
!docs/roadmap.md
!docs/testing.md
!docs/troubleshooting.md
!docs/images/
